anaged to discover a dish, it can even be made at home based on its recipe in the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518000/extras/9acd6c7cfe89d380f6621a15c320bce5.poster.avif?t=1725188600\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518000/extras/9acd6c7cfe89d380f6621a15c320bce5.webm?t=1725188600\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1518000/extras/9acd6c7cfe89d380f6621a15c320bce5.mp4?t=1725188600\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Find out what ingredients can be used to make the dishes on the menu<br></li><li>Normal (two-ingredients) and difficult (three-ingredients) foods<br></li><li>Increasingly harder challenges, more complex puzzles<br></li><li>The discovered dishes can actually be prepared based on the recipes in the game<br></li><li>8 different menus with typical national dishes</li></ul>",
